#==============================================================================================
#
#   paintable_with_lines_1 - Painting::PaintableWithLines: a box with line box fragments
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/PaintableWithLines.cpp (lines 1-480) and PaintableWithLines.h:
#       the paintable of a block container or of one line of an inline node, its fragments,
#       hit testing of the fragments (with the text cursor mode's nearest fragment edges), the
#       text decoration thickness and shadows of its text fragments, painting the foreground
#       (selection backgrounds, text shadows, text and the cursor) and the render spans of a
#       fragment split at the selection.
